      "selection": "Train ranks proposals by (loss, entry handle, exit handle). Development selects from the top eight plus unchanged initial by (development loss, entry handle, exit handle). Held-out targets are generated only after both family checkpoints are fixed; no fallback or seed selection from held-out outcomes. Hand all three seeds to evaluator."
    },
    "target": "Consume independent GESTURE-002 analytic target_points; target assembly uses frozen original primitives and endpoint translations only, never candidate grammar, handles or recipes. No source or locked real-test pixels.",
