    "metrics": {
      "image_loss": "Existing stroke_loss: normalized absolute ink difference, identical physical frame and DPI",
      "held_out": "Every fixture and each participating family per seed must have nominal learned/initial image loss ratio <0.75. Family-local crop is frozen to the return endpoint neighborhood x[-0.25,0.80], y[-0.50,0.50], scaled and translated with that occurrence, including its attachment ink. Zero initial loss is undefined and fails rather than giving free improvement. Full construction loss is also required.",
